# Click the diff view toggle in the tab row, then widen the terminal and click it again. The diff
# has one hunk, so it has no separators between hunks. The pointer moves away before each snapshot,
# because the button hover color differs between the apps (checklist section 4).
fixture demo
wait text "Working Changes"
click 60 13
wait text "COMMIT FILES"
click 124 20
wait text "Start here"
snapshot first-mode
click 137 1
move 100 30
# The blank cells after "Inline" have a different foreground color. Nobody sees it.
mask 141 1 8 1
snapshot second-mode
click 137 1
move 100 30
snapshot third-mode
click 137 1
move 100 30
snapshot back-to-first
# The footer notice expires 6 s after the commit click, which is about now. Mask it.
mask 120 47 100 1
resize 220 48
move 100 30
mask 201 1 8 1
snapshot wide-terminal
click 137 1
move 100 30
snapshot wide-toggled
